---
title: With an accent line
order: 5
hiddenH2: true
---
<norn-card-grid>
	<li style="--norn-card-accent: var(--norn-ui-accent, #2346d4)">
		<norn-card>
			<h3><a href="https://example.com/">An accent line</a></h3>
			<p>Set --norn-card-accent on the card or its list item to draw a 2px line along the top.</p>
		</norn-card>
	</li>
	<li>
		<norn-card>
			<h3><a href="https://example.com/">No accent</a></h3>
			<p>Unset, the card has only its fill.</p>
		</norn-card>
	</li>
</norn-card-grid>
